{"ids":{"anilist":20658,"mal":23259},"titles":{"romaji":"Gundam: G no Reconguista","english":"Gundam: Reconguista in G","native":"ガンダム Gのレコンギスタ"},"format":"TV","status":"FINISHED","season":"FALL","season_year":2014,"episodes":26,"duration":24,"description":"Some time has passed since the end of the Universal Century, a history marked by space colonization and space warfare.<br>\nHumanity's prosperity, which ushered in a new era known as Regild Century (R.C.), was believed to endure alongside the global peace.<br>\n<br>\nIt is the year R.C.1014.<br>\n<br>\nThe Capital Tower is an orbital elevator that rose above the Earth's surface and linked Earth and space. As the conduit of the Photon Battery energy source to the surface, it is regarded as sacred.<br>\n<br>\nBellri Zenam is in the middle of training for the Capital Guard (established to protect the Capital Tower), when the tower is attacked by the G-Self — a highly maneuverable mobile suit with technology that is not from any known country.<br>\n<br>\nBellri, who joins the battle in the maintenance mobile suit Recten, successfully captures the G-Self. However, Bellri feels something for the space pirate girl named Aida Surugan who piloted the G-Self. It is the same feeling he has for the G-Self, even though he supposedly never seen it before. The G-Self, which should only be operable under specific conditions, is somehow started up by Bellri.<br>\nThe objective of Aida and the space pirates who attacked the Capital Tower, and the fate followed by Bellri who was chosen by the G-Self, will lead to truths that will shake the entire Regild Century era.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)\n<br>\n<br>\nThe first 3 episodes premiered theatrically from August 23, 2014 to September 5, 2014 with the regular TV broadcast starting on October 3, 2014.","genres":["Action","Mecha","Sci-Fi"],"score_anilist":57,"popularity":10888,"images":{"poster":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20658-P5QBsXm